<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Emperor Int'l shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Emperor Int'l shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property holding and investment concern Emperor International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.025 lower at HK$2.175 on Tuesday. Volume was 378,333 shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
